：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：情报部小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-05-29 17:19<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2F94H7vfPZTj-NfUh2uccvdQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/94H7vfPZTj-NfUh2uccvdQ</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"120\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n<br /><br />\n团长们好呀，这里是小场记(～￣▽￣)～\n<br /><br />\n最近天气真是太热啦，小场记本人要被晒晕~昏昏沉沉掐指一算，诶？上半年这就过完啦？【铃兰纪事簿】也该拍拍灰更新了！伊利亚局势日益紧张，纪事簿还空空如也Σ(っ °Д °;)っ小场记是断不会让这种事情发生的！今天就给各位团长带来伊利亚势力篇的介绍~\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息140.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e1/4oolq7gvyfny4b21i2rd83zvniu7pbf.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"2316\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"2316\" />\n<br /><br />\n纪事簿伊利亚特别篇到此结束啦！下篇将会介绍哪里呢！团长们尽请期待哟✧*｡٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و✧*\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163724\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 88/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2332/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 268/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.466      1 -total\n 53.24%   16.220      1 模板:面包屑\n 46.47%   14.159      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llz